  {
    "original": "Summon a Sulking Twilight for one day. Twilights originate from Moonshadow, though they are intelligent, capable of scheming and straying from the grace of Azura to achieve their own aims. This one has been branded by Namira, and while it no longer can fly, it is a terrible foe.",
